<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quilmes cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quilmes cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday it had cut its rating on Luxembourg-based Quilmes Industrial SA to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The beverage company's American Depositary Receipts closed at 9-1/8 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
